omy 11:30\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.11.30\">Dt 11:30</a>; with other n.pr.gent., + <span dir=\"rtl\">הַפְּרִזִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 13:7\" href=\"/Genesis.13.7\">Gn 13:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 34:30\" href=\"/Genesis.34.30\">34:30</a> (both J), <a data-ref=\"Judges 1:4\" href=\"/Judges.1.4\">Ju 1:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 1:5\" href=\"/Judges.1.5\">5</a>, + <span dir=\"rtl\">הָאֱמֹרִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 1:7\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.1.7\">Dt 1:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 5:1\" href=\"/Joshua.5.1\">Jos 5:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:4\" href=\"/Joshua.13.4\">13:4</a> (all D); + <span dir=\"rtl\">הַחִוִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:7\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.7\">2 S 24:7</a>; + <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲמָלֵקִ(י)</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:25\" href=\"/Numbers.14.25\">Nu 14:25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:43\" href=\"/Numbers.14.43\">43</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:45\" href=\"/Numbers.14.45\">45</a>; especially in the list of peoples dispossessed by Isr., <a data-ref=\"Genesis 15:21\" href=\"/Genesis.15.21\">Gn 15:21</a> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 3:8\" href=\"/Exodus.3.8\">Ex 3:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 3:17\" href=\"/Exodus.3.17\">17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 13:5\" href=\"/Exodus.13.5\">13:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:23\" href=\"/Exodus.23.23\">23:23</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:28\" href=\"/Exodus.23.28\">28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 33:2\" href=\"/Exodus.33.2\">33:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:11\" href=\"/Exodus.34.11\">34:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:29\" href=\"/Numbers.13.29\">Nu 13:29</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">הַכּ׳</span> dwelling by the sea and along Jordan [cf. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 1:7\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.1.7\">Dt 1:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 11:30\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.11.30\">11:30</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 5:1\" href=\"/Joshua.5.1\">Jos 5:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:3\" href=\"/Joshua.11.3\">11:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:4\" href=\"/Joshua.13.4\">13:4</a>]; all these JE), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:1\" 